    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blink is no longer a reflex, it\u2019s a choice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After undergoing invasive eye experiments, your body betrays you. You\u2019re trapped in a shuttered  hospital where every blink risks shifting reality and the doctor\u2019s gaze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/9d0ca8f8043644b565159a84fb9bf9f7.poster.avif?t=1754910176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/9d0ca8f8043644b565159a84fb9bf9f7.webm?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/9d0ca8f8043644b565159a84fb9bf9f7.mp4?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veil of Sight</strong> is a story-based first\u2011person psychological horror game, built on atmospheric tension and unsteady perception. Explore decaying hallways, piece together environmental clues and evade the masked doctor who made you this way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/672905c04e65de15daf01afdb0e6ac0c.poster.avif?t=1754910176\" width=788 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/672905c04e65de15daf01afdb0e6ac0c.webm?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/672905c04e65de15daf01afdb0e6ac0c.mp4?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual blinking mechanic</strong>: Hold and release your blink at your own risk. Some things move when your eyes are closed but resisting the urge to blink for too long will blur your vision and distort reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension without cheap scares:</strong> Fear builds through atmosphere, sound and subtle changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Uncover what happened through scattered notes, recordings and symbols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/7dd1fd13c4049d2f282c4fe3219c1475.poster.avif?t=1754910176\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/7dd1fd13c4049d2f282c4fe3219c1475.webm?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/7dd1fd13c4049d2f282c4fe3219c1475.mp4?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blink is no longer a reflex, it\u2019s a choice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After undergoing invasive eye experiments, your body betrays you. You\u2019re trapped in a shuttered  hospital where every blink risks shifting reality and the doctor\u2019s gaze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/9d0ca8f8043644b565159a84fb9bf9f7.poster.avif?t=1754910176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/9d0ca8f8043644b565159a84fb9bf9f7.webm?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/9d0ca8f8043644b565159a84fb9bf9f7.mp4?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veil of Sight</strong> is a story-based first\u2011person psychological horror game, built on atmospheric tension and unsteady perception. Explore decaying hallways, piece together environmental clues and evade the masked doctor who made you this way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/672905c04e65de15daf01afdb0e6ac0c.poster.avif?t=1754910176\" width=788 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/672905c04e65de15daf01afdb0e6ac0c.webm?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/672905c04e65de15daf01afdb0e6ac0c.mp4?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual blinking mechanic</strong>: Hold and release your blink at your own risk. Some things move when your eyes are closed but resisting the urge to blink for too long will blur your vision and distort reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension without cheap scares:</strong> Fear builds through atmosphere, sound and subtle changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Uncover what happened through scattered notes, recordings and symbols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/7dd1fd13c4049d2f282c4fe3219c1475.poster.avif?t=1754910176\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/7dd1fd13c4049d2f282c4fe3219c1475.webm?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850370/extras/7dd1fd13c4049d2f282c4fe3219c1475.mp4?t=1754910176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
